      "comment": "If Journey to Eternity and the enchanted creature are both put into graveyards at the same time, Journey to Eternity's ability will return both to the battlefield."
    },
    {
      "oracle_id": "7d6ccd0b-df16-40b2-930b-bcde0b6ef73f",
      "published_at": "2018-01-19",
      "source": "wotc",
      "comment": "If Journey to Eternity enchants a creature you control but don't own, the creature will return to the battlefield under your control from its owner's graveyard when it dies. In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any creatures you control from Journey to Eternity's effect are exiled."
    },
    {
      "oracle_id": "7d6ccd0b-df16-40b2-930b-bcde0b6ef73f",
